  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 10th level, an aethernaut can use mental and physical resiliency to avoid certain attacks. If he makes a Fortitude or Will saving throw against an attack that has a reduced effect on a successful save, he instead avoids the effect entirely. This ability does not function while the aethernaut is helpless or wearing heavy armor.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/aethernaut#toc40\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
